WEBVTT

01:38.039 --> 01:40.660
[Fate Chooses You]

01:41.300 --> 01:43.680
[Episode 30]

01:46.479 --> 01:47.000
Go!

01:47.479 --> 01:48.610
I can walk by myself.

01:55.280 --> 01:56.000
Kneel down!

01:59.870 --> 02:00.790
Behave yourself.

02:00.790 --> 02:02.040
Look at where you are!

02:04.040 --> 02:04.920
Where?

02:06.430 --> 02:08.150
What a huge cesspit.

02:09.080 --> 02:10.410
With so many of you here,

02:10.800 --> 02:12.910
are you lining up to use the latrine?

02:13.000 --> 02:13.800
Slap his face.

02:16.910 --> 02:19.640
Let's see
if you still dare to behave insolently.

02:20.360 --> 02:21.560
This man is Lin Muhan,

02:21.800 --> 02:23.520
the Young Sect Master of Lingji Mountain.

02:23.520 --> 02:24.210
A few days ago,

02:24.210 --> 02:26.210
he and a group of immortal sect thugs

02:26.280 --> 02:28.120
hunted down another group of human scum

02:28.120 --> 02:29.170
who acted in the name of the false god

02:29.170 --> 02:30.630
and committed evil deeds,

02:30.840 --> 02:32.190
burning the ancient books

02:32.190 --> 02:34.240
stored in the Sihe Library of our sect,

02:34.240 --> 02:36.520
causing a thousand years of heritage
to be destroyed in a fire.

02:36.520 --> 02:37.320
By all rights,

02:37.590 --> 02:38.630
he should be executed.

02:38.630 --> 02:42.030
Kill him! Kill him! Kill him!

02:42.750 --> 02:43.560
Presumably,

02:44.000 --> 02:45.660
some people have experienced

02:45.910 --> 02:48.520
all the injustices in this world.

02:48.910 --> 02:50.170
The goals we strive for

02:50.190 --> 02:51.710
all our lives

02:52.120 --> 02:54.630
are merely the starting point
for those immortals.

02:54.630 --> 02:56.230
Just because they have noble bloodlines

02:56.230 --> 02:57.630
and extraordinary backgrounds,

02:57.630 --> 02:59.470
they are born with everything.

03:00.240 --> 03:02.750
Without immortal perception,
one cannot cultivate.

03:02.750 --> 03:05.750
That is an insurmountable gap

03:06.080 --> 03:07.800
separating mortals and immortals.

03:07.800 --> 03:09.730
Why are they born with everything,

03:09.730 --> 03:11.500
while we are not?

03:11.590 --> 03:12.680
Unfair!

03:12.750 --> 03:13.750
Unfair!

03:13.840 --> 03:14.960
Unfair!

03:17.450 --> 03:19.930
You said the cultivators

03:20.250 --> 03:21.650
were cruel and ruthless,

03:21.710 --> 03:23.570
not treating you as human beings,

03:23.590 --> 03:26.430
and taking whatever they wanted
from your Wang family.

03:26.430 --> 03:27.000
Yes.

03:28.140 --> 03:29.630
These damn cultivators

03:30.120 --> 03:32.380
have made our Wang family suffer so much.

03:34.750 --> 03:37.360
Whenever I think of the tragic deaths
of my father and brothers,

03:37.360 --> 03:38.910
I wish I could eat them alive

03:39.750 --> 03:40.840
or tear them apart.

03:43.840 --> 03:45.150
If right now,

03:45.400 --> 03:46.310
there is a chance

03:46.310 --> 03:47.840
right in front of you,

03:48.079 --> 03:49.360
granting you a kind

03:49.560 --> 03:51.560
of immortal perception for cultivation

03:51.560 --> 03:53.310
as well as immense power,

03:53.800 --> 03:56.280
dare you fight the immortal sects?

03:58.750 --> 04:00.000
It's what I seek,

04:00.800 --> 04:02.930
and I will never regret it until death.

04:03.400 --> 04:04.310
Good.

04:04.680 --> 04:06.310
I will grant your wish today.

04:07.000 --> 04:08.520
Lingji Mountain

04:08.520 --> 04:10.710
Young Sect Master's immortal perception

04:10.710 --> 04:11.710
will be yours,

04:11.960 --> 04:13.360
paving a path for you

04:13.380 --> 04:15.700
to change your fate and seek revenge.

04:21.480 --> 04:22.070
Go

04:22.480 --> 04:23.720
and use this knife

04:24.430 --> 04:26.430
to dig out his immortal perception.

05:02.750 --> 05:04.010
Young Sect Master Lin,

05:04.830 --> 05:06.030
may you rest in peace.

05:06.870 --> 05:09.510
I will make good use
of your immortal perception.

05:09.510 --> 05:10.360
And by the way,

05:10.950 --> 05:12.680
I will take care of your father.

05:14.630 --> 05:16.630
It's a pity my father is a neat freak.

05:17.040 --> 05:19.120
He never gets along with nasty beasts.

05:19.120 --> 05:19.870
And he didn't

05:20.220 --> 05:22.020
have an affair with your mother.

05:22.380 --> 05:23.360
I'm afraid he won't like

05:23.360 --> 05:24.600
a lowlife like you.

05:33.710 --> 05:34.830
I will take care

05:35.630 --> 05:36.830
of my father myself.

05:37.560 --> 05:39.120
May you not rest in peace.

05:40.159 --> 05:41.420
If there is a next life,

05:43.000 --> 05:44.310
I will kill you again.

06:01.390 --> 06:02.750
Surrender now,

06:03.360 --> 06:04.820
and maybe you can survive.

06:06.390 --> 06:07.950
He actually got it right.

06:08.660 --> 06:09.860
What a jinx.

06:10.830 --> 06:12.290
Who are you talking about?

06:13.000 --> 06:14.060
I'll take my leave.

06:14.310 --> 06:15.170
See you around.

06:16.800 --> 06:17.460
Be careful.

06:18.310 --> 06:20.440
You have very likely been discovered.

06:22.070 --> 06:23.930
You disobeyed him time and again.

06:24.080 --> 06:25.610
He couldn't have missed it.

06:28.040 --> 06:29.000
Do you need help?

06:30.270 --> 06:30.950
No need.

06:31.430 --> 06:32.690
I can handle it myself.

06:38.000 --> 06:40.240
The Master raised you single-handedly,

06:40.240 --> 06:41.570
treating you as his own.

06:41.950 --> 06:43.950
He not only gave you wealth and glory

06:44.210 --> 06:45.360
but also allowed you to hold

06:45.360 --> 06:47.010
the position of Vajra in the sect.

06:47.010 --> 06:48.240
Yet you betrayed the Master

06:48.240 --> 06:49.270
and the Holy Sect!

06:50.870 --> 06:51.530
Never mind.

06:51.950 --> 06:54.080
I have nothing to say to a fool like you.

06:54.430 --> 06:56.510
You wouldn't understand
even if I told you.

06:56.510 --> 06:57.159
Come on.

06:57.750 --> 06:58.950
Let's do it directly.

07:02.360 --> 07:04.750
A mere cultivator
at Foundation Establishment Stage like you

07:04.750 --> 07:06.160
dares to fight me?

07:06.600 --> 07:07.430
Who told you

07:07.950 --> 07:11.010
that I am just
a Foundation Establishment cultivator?

07:18.900 --> 07:19.580
You're

07:20.000 --> 07:21.260
at Nascent Soul Stage?

07:22.920 --> 07:23.510
How is it?

07:24.800 --> 07:25.600
It's fine now.

07:27.160 --> 07:27.960
I'm done, too.

07:29.390 --> 07:30.190
Then let's go.

07:56.000 --> 07:57.200
The carrier of heaven

07:57.800 --> 07:59.510
creates something out of nothing;

07:59.510 --> 08:01.240
movement and stillness without cause;

08:01.240 --> 08:03.040
Yin and Yang without beginning.

08:04.960 --> 08:05.630
Open!

08:19.510 --> 08:20.120
I,

08:20.510 --> 08:21.510
Lin Muhan,

08:22.240 --> 08:25.040
am the 5th-generation direct disciple
of Lingji Mountain.

08:25.040 --> 08:26.210
Who dares to challenge me?

08:26.210 --> 08:26.980
Kill him!

08:40.390 --> 08:41.190
Junior Jiang,

08:41.630 --> 08:42.559
why are you here?

08:42.960 --> 08:44.690
Where is Senior Bai being held?

09:02.110 --> 09:02.720
Take this.

09:32.550 --> 09:34.210
Where is Senior Bai locked up?

09:34.670 --> 09:36.070
That man was caught, too?

09:36.960 --> 09:37.890
I didn't see him.

09:39.720 --> 09:41.520
I have sent a message to our sect.

09:41.600 --> 09:43.530
Reinforcements will arrive soon.

09:43.560 --> 09:44.920
If you want to survive,

09:45.440 --> 09:46.790
let us go immediately.

09:48.450 --> 09:50.330
Not to mention that they can't come,

09:50.330 --> 09:51.420
even if they do,

09:51.840 --> 09:53.840
they will end up dying with regrets.

10:00.320 --> 10:01.910
One is at Foundation Establishment.

10:01.910 --> 10:03.120
One is at Golden Core.

10:03.840 --> 10:06.240
Both have top-grade immortal perception,

10:06.320 --> 10:09.720
and both are Heavenly Talents
of their immortal sects.

10:10.200 --> 10:11.240
I wonder

10:11.360 --> 10:13.200
which lucky dog will benefit

10:13.390 --> 10:16.750
from their immortal perception
we dig out today.

10:20.030 --> 10:21.200
Lu Qianqiao,

10:22.150 --> 10:24.010
if you still don't show yourself,

10:24.080 --> 10:25.870
I'm going to make my move.

10:53.320 --> 10:54.520
You knew I would come.

10:55.000 --> 10:57.480
You are just a righteous, merciful,

10:57.720 --> 11:00.050
and stubborn fool who can't make choices.

11:00.440 --> 11:01.390
That girl

11:02.080 --> 11:03.750
who made a blood pact with you

11:04.080 --> 11:06.540
must be someone extremely important
to you.

11:06.840 --> 11:07.840
Since she is here,

11:09.030 --> 11:10.890
there's no way you're not coming.

11:11.600 --> 11:13.000
You really know me well.

11:14.750 --> 11:15.600
Fan,

11:16.230 --> 11:17.510
long time no see.

11:38.150 --> 11:38.960
Senior Bai?

11:49.440 --> 11:50.150
Senior Bai!

11:51.320 --> 11:52.200
Xin Mei.

11:53.670 --> 11:54.360
Hurry.

11:54.840 --> 11:55.910
Kill me.

11:57.080 --> 11:58.340
What's wrong with you?

11:59.150 --> 12:01.210
His immortal perception was dug out.

12:03.910 --> 12:04.770
Senior Sister,

12:04.910 --> 12:05.790
we have to go.

12:14.390 --> 12:15.600
Leave me alone.

12:16.230 --> 12:17.120
Just go.

12:20.510 --> 12:21.670
I can't survive.

12:22.390 --> 12:23.360
It's not only cultivators

12:23.360 --> 12:24.490
who deserve to live.

12:24.960 --> 12:25.720
Come with me.

12:39.200 --> 12:40.440
You recalled it?

12:40.600 --> 12:41.150
Yes,

12:41.670 --> 12:43.000
I recalled everything.

12:43.200 --> 12:44.030
Some things

12:44.790 --> 12:46.220
can be avoided for a while,

12:46.220 --> 12:47.480
but not for a lifetime.

12:48.150 --> 12:49.840
Even if you don't want to face them,

12:49.840 --> 12:50.670
there will always be a day

12:50.670 --> 12:51.870
you have to face them.

12:52.200 --> 12:53.910
Like birth, aging, illness, and death.

12:53.910 --> 12:55.600
Like the impermanence of the world.

12:55.600 --> 12:56.320
Like

12:56.870 --> 12:57.870
you and me.

12:59.120 --> 13:00.120
So pessimistic.

13:01.320 --> 13:02.790
I still miss

13:03.550 --> 13:05.030
our old days.

13:07.000 --> 13:08.000
You miss them?

13:08.270 --> 13:09.150
Of course.

13:09.750 --> 13:11.960
At that time, my family was in poverty.

13:12.270 --> 13:13.150
My father was

13:13.720 --> 13:15.240
a terrible gambler.

13:15.840 --> 13:17.320
When I was 7 or 8,

13:17.630 --> 13:18.960
he sold me.

13:19.510 --> 13:21.840
After being passed around several times,

13:22.000 --> 13:22.720
I ended up

13:23.360 --> 13:24.960
being brought by that woman.

13:25.510 --> 13:27.150
She took me to Liubo Temple.

13:27.270 --> 13:28.730
At first, I was very happy.

13:28.790 --> 13:29.550
I thought

13:30.000 --> 13:31.360
I had finally lucked out

13:32.000 --> 13:33.150
and entered the immortal sect

13:33.150 --> 13:34.840
to be a person of high status

13:35.270 --> 13:36.970
and trample those

13:37.390 --> 13:38.790
who used to look down on me

13:38.960 --> 13:40.320
and bully me.

13:40.870 --> 13:41.840
What a pity.

13:42.000 --> 13:43.910
I was born without immortal perception

13:43.910 --> 13:45.120
and couldn't cultivate.

13:45.120 --> 13:46.580
I could only do some chores

13:46.700 --> 13:49.030
in the Liubo Temple, like carrying water,

13:49.030 --> 13:51.240
washing clothes, and cooking.

13:52.200 --> 13:53.960
How old were you when you first came

13:53.960 --> 13:55.090
to the Liubo Temple?

13:56.150 --> 13:57.000
I remember

13:57.670 --> 13:59.000
you were only this tall.

13:59.750 --> 14:01.410
I was a little taller than you.

14:06.930 --> 14:08.730
You were a warm-hearted person.

14:09.080 --> 14:11.240
You taught me to read, write,

14:11.550 --> 14:12.270
play chess,

14:12.670 --> 14:13.550
and draw.

14:14.390 --> 14:15.080
As for me,

14:15.360 --> 14:16.290
I cooked for you.

14:17.150 --> 14:19.060
You couldn't tell
whether it tasted good or not.

14:19.060 --> 14:20.270
But I still felt

14:20.300 --> 14:21.380
we were friends.

14:22.550 --> 14:23.480
But today,

14:24.510 --> 14:25.550
is this how

14:25.550 --> 14:26.880
you treat me as a friend?

14:32.030 --> 14:32.720
What?

14:33.630 --> 14:35.160
Have I ever hurt your heart?

14:35.910 --> 14:37.030
Did you kill the people

14:37.030 --> 14:38.560
of the Bishui Branch or not?

14:38.960 --> 14:40.120
Was the Sihe Library

14:40.670 --> 14:42.470
destroyed because of you or not?

14:42.960 --> 14:43.910
You were injured,

14:43.910 --> 14:45.080
and I went to save you,

14:45.080 --> 14:46.720
but you bit the hand that fed you

14:46.720 --> 14:48.250
and killed my sect members!

14:48.270 --> 14:49.960
I won't hold any of these against you.

14:49.960 --> 14:51.890
I just want to ask you one question.

14:53.000 --> 14:54.720
What are you up to

14:55.360 --> 14:56.750
at the altar today?

14:58.360 --> 14:59.960
It's been years since we last met.

14:59.960 --> 15:02.440
You are more eloquent than before.

15:03.960 --> 15:05.440
It's been so many years,

15:06.030 --> 15:07.720
yet you are still so stupid.

15:16.870 --> 15:18.360
I heard that the Qinghong Sect

15:18.360 --> 15:20.160
was established during the war.

15:20.480 --> 15:21.280
Some scholars

15:21.720 --> 15:23.720
took it as their duty
to protect ancient books

15:23.720 --> 15:25.450
and committed themselves to resisting

15:25.450 --> 15:26.790
the immortal sects' erosion
and destruction

15:26.790 --> 15:28.120
of human civilization.

15:28.320 --> 15:29.000
Later,

15:29.530 --> 15:31.080
more and more ordinary people

15:31.080 --> 15:32.750
who hated the immortal sects joined,

15:32.750 --> 15:34.720
gradually embarking on a path of faith

15:34.720 --> 15:36.510
to resist the oppression
of the immortal sects

15:36.510 --> 15:37.870
and maintain the heritage

15:37.870 --> 15:39.080
of the Human Race.

15:41.720 --> 15:43.520
The affairs of the Qinghong Sect

15:43.550 --> 15:45.080
have nothing to do with you.

15:45.320 --> 15:47.120
But you used the secret technique
of the Liubo Temple

15:47.120 --> 15:48.720
to win over the sect members.

15:48.790 --> 15:50.590
This has something to do with me.

15:53.150 --> 15:55.840
Back then, Master failed to break through
for a long time

15:55.840 --> 15:56.840
and could only raise her realm

15:56.840 --> 15:57.870
by seizing

15:58.000 --> 15:59.730
others' immortal perception.

16:00.030 --> 16:00.790
At that time,

16:01.120 --> 16:02.320
both you and I felt pity

16:02.320 --> 16:04.050
for those killed cultivators.

16:04.870 --> 16:05.930
But I didn't expect

16:06.390 --> 16:07.790
that after so many years,

16:08.320 --> 16:10.580
you'd have become someone just like her.

16:11.080 --> 16:11.870
This is the only way

16:11.870 --> 16:14.360
for us ordinary people
without immortal perception

16:14.360 --> 16:16.630
to gain power.

16:19.840 --> 16:20.910
So,

16:21.440 --> 16:22.440
just like everyone else

16:22.440 --> 16:23.640
in the Qinghong Sect,

16:23.910 --> 16:26.110
you hate the immortal sects extremely,

16:26.440 --> 16:27.150
right?

16:29.030 --> 16:29.910
Cut the crap!

16:30.360 --> 16:30.960
And don't think

16:30.960 --> 16:32.030
just because you're
our master's old acquaintance,

16:32.030 --> 16:33.630
you can spout nonsense here!

16:33.790 --> 16:35.120
If you disrespect our master,

16:35.120 --> 16:36.320
we'll still kill you!

16:44.440 --> 16:45.870
Do you have any more Yangyuan Pills?

16:45.870 --> 16:46.730
Yes, of course.

16:50.270 --> 16:51.240
Tell everyone

16:51.840 --> 16:52.750
what this is

16:53.150 --> 16:54.480
and what effects it has.

16:54.480 --> 16:56.010
Listen carefully, you all.

16:56.440 --> 16:57.480
This is our immortal sects'

16:57.480 --> 16:59.270
secret medicine, the Yangyuan Pill.

16:59.270 --> 17:00.930
It can heal wounds, stop pain,

17:01.080 --> 17:02.270
restore vitality,

17:02.410 --> 17:04.210
and make spiritual power surge.

17:04.800 --> 17:06.030
We usually use this medicine

17:06.030 --> 17:07.480
to heal wounds, stop bleeding,

17:07.480 --> 17:08.940
improve spiritual power,

17:08.960 --> 17:11.420
aid cultivation, and break through realms.

17:11.790 --> 17:12.990
In critical moments,

17:13.720 --> 17:15.180
it can even save your life.

17:17.880 --> 17:18.920
Do these effects

17:19.109 --> 17:20.109
sound familiar?

17:21.349 --> 17:22.510
Does this share

17:22.750 --> 17:25.319
the same origin
as your Phoenix God's golden liquid

17:25.319 --> 17:26.710
that changes your fate?

17:37.590 --> 17:38.160
You...

17:38.510 --> 17:39.710
Don't talk nonsense!

17:40.920 --> 17:42.180
Am I talking nonsense?

17:43.480 --> 17:44.160
Fan,

17:44.790 --> 17:46.320
do you want to tell everyone

17:46.790 --> 17:48.310
which immortal sect is

17:48.680 --> 17:49.790
behind you?

18:05.270 --> 18:07.070
I really underestimated you.

18:07.570 --> 18:08.920
The Master used
the Secret Nine Breaths Technique

18:08.920 --> 18:10.250
to seal your acupoints.

18:10.550 --> 18:11.610
How did you escape?

18:11.920 --> 18:12.780
Stop guessing.

18:13.180 --> 18:14.160
You couldn't figure it out

18:14.160 --> 18:14.920
with your thick skull.

18:14.920 --> 18:16.400
You really want to die.

18:17.680 --> 18:18.310
Kill them!

18:46.160 --> 18:48.410
In the disguise
of rebelling against the immortal sects,

18:48.410 --> 18:49.400
you use these commoners to work

18:49.400 --> 18:50.590
and risk their lives for you.

18:50.590 --> 18:53.200
You also utilized
the Sihe Library and Wushuang Society

18:53.200 --> 18:55.440
to lure immortal sect disciples
to North Xiang,

18:55.440 --> 18:57.000
snatch their immortal perception,

18:57.000 --> 18:59.070
and turn it
into Phoenix God's golden liquid

18:59.070 --> 19:00.530
for your own cultivation.

19:00.550 --> 19:02.680
Then you dilute it into Yangyuan Pills

19:02.960 --> 19:05.200
to give to the immortal sect members
behind you,

19:05.200 --> 19:06.590
helping them amass wealth,

19:06.590 --> 19:07.920
aiding their cultivation,

19:07.920 --> 19:09.450
and acting as their lapdog.

19:09.480 --> 19:10.310
Don't you plan

19:10.920 --> 19:12.030
to tell your followers

19:12.030 --> 19:13.000
these things?

19:13.400 --> 19:14.000
Master,

19:14.460 --> 19:15.720
he's talking nonsense, right?

19:15.720 --> 19:16.550
This is impossible.

19:16.550 --> 19:17.680
This is impossible!

19:17.830 --> 19:18.880
I don't believe it.

19:18.880 --> 19:20.000
How could the Master do such a thing?

19:20.000 --> 19:21.400
We believe in the Master.

19:24.160 --> 19:25.160
Lu,

19:26.110 --> 19:27.520
do we really have to come

19:27.550 --> 19:28.550
to this point?

19:29.150 --> 19:30.410
Back at Liubo Temple,

19:30.440 --> 19:31.750
there were only the three of us.

19:31.750 --> 19:32.720
Even so,

19:33.200 --> 19:34.400
she still drew

19:34.400 --> 19:35.600
a class distinction.

19:36.070 --> 19:37.870
You could focus on cultivation.

19:38.270 --> 19:39.270
But I,

19:40.000 --> 19:42.860
destined to be lowly
without immortal perception,

19:43.160 --> 19:45.350
could only do some menial work.

20:01.110 --> 20:02.270
Please spare me, Temple Master!

20:02.270 --> 20:04.200
Please forgive me, Temple Master!

20:04.790 --> 20:05.440
Get lost.

20:13.440 --> 20:19.390
[Liubo Temple]

20:13.540 --> 20:16.160
Later, that woman died.

20:16.720 --> 20:18.310
I left Liubo Temple

20:18.840 --> 20:20.510
and came to the Qinghong Sect.

20:20.720 --> 20:21.480
Lu,

20:23.240 --> 20:24.110
come with me.

20:24.440 --> 20:25.970
Let's leave here together.

20:26.790 --> 20:27.990
If we stick together,

20:28.030 --> 20:29.830
we will surely have a great life.

20:30.070 --> 20:30.730
No, thanks.

20:31.400 --> 20:32.800
Where are you going then?

20:33.510 --> 20:34.640
I don't know either.

20:35.130 --> 20:37.810
Maybe to atone for Master's death,

20:38.510 --> 20:40.590
or maybe to find my father.

20:42.550 --> 20:43.240
Fan,

20:44.070 --> 20:45.030
no matter what,

20:45.240 --> 20:46.970
I hope you get what you wish for.

20:49.790 --> 20:50.480
Lu,

20:51.000 --> 20:52.000
just wait and see.

20:52.400 --> 20:54.460
I will definitely live a decent life!

20:59.240 --> 21:00.240
What's your name?

21:00.720 --> 21:01.440
Fan.

21:01.750 --> 21:03.680
You want to join the Qinghong Sect?

21:03.680 --> 21:04.270
Yes.

21:04.550 --> 21:05.200
Yes!

21:06.270 --> 21:08.000
Only when I got here did I realize

21:08.000 --> 21:10.260
that this was just a larger Liubo Temple.

21:10.640 --> 21:12.480
What they say or do

21:12.720 --> 21:13.680
doesn't matter.

21:13.830 --> 21:15.350
Just to stay alive.

21:15.750 --> 21:17.610
Living well is what's important.

21:18.030 --> 21:18.880
Since then,

21:19.110 --> 21:21.270
on every sleepless night,

21:21.400 --> 21:23.590
I would think of that day.

21:24.350 --> 21:25.960
If I had followed you,

21:26.070 --> 21:27.550
or you had followed me,

21:28.160 --> 21:31.480
would things turn out differently?

21:32.920 --> 21:34.780
Unfortunately, just as you said,

21:35.210 --> 21:36.410
there is no

21:36.440 --> 21:38.480
magical artifact to turn back time
in this world,

21:38.480 --> 21:41.880
nor is there a second chance in life.

21:50.240 --> 21:51.030
Coward,

21:51.760 --> 21:53.040
clean it up.

21:54.350 --> 21:57.590
I secretly swore to myself

21:57.920 --> 21:58.880
that I must not let

21:58.880 --> 22:00.480
others look down on me again.

22:00.680 --> 22:02.030
I would climb my way

22:02.270 --> 22:04.550
step by step to the center of power.

22:05.110 --> 22:07.640
I wanted to live a better life
than everyone else,

22:07.640 --> 22:08.590
including you!

22:10.160 --> 22:11.640
So I returned

22:11.640 --> 22:12.590
to that place

22:13.000 --> 22:14.600
and found the evil technique

22:14.640 --> 22:16.310
that she had been practicing.

22:16.790 --> 22:18.640
I used to despise her.

22:19.200 --> 22:20.240
But now,

22:20.900 --> 22:21.850
this is my way

22:21.880 --> 22:24.240
of surviving.

22:29.790 --> 22:31.240
Liars shout slogans,

22:31.440 --> 22:32.640
madmen believe them,

22:32.720 --> 22:34.160
and fools die.

22:36.500 --> 22:37.850
Do you think there is

22:37.880 --> 22:39.510
only one Qinghong Sect in this world?

22:39.510 --> 22:40.110
No!

22:41.640 --> 22:42.790
This world

22:43.010 --> 22:44.080
is actually

22:44.100 --> 22:45.710
a larger battlefield.

22:46.310 --> 22:47.580
For profit,

22:47.960 --> 22:48.790
power,

22:49.110 --> 22:49.880
and fame,

22:50.160 --> 22:51.880
people will do whatever it takes

22:51.880 --> 22:53.550
to fight to the death.

22:53.880 --> 22:55.410
If everyone else does this,

22:55.510 --> 22:56.720
why can't I?

22:57.200 --> 22:58.460
I just want to survive!

22:58.960 --> 23:00.720
To survive is the most basic

23:00.920 --> 23:02.850
and justified thing in this world!

23:03.070 --> 23:04.830
There's nothing wrong
with wanting to survive.

23:04.830 --> 23:06.160
But in order to survive,

23:06.350 --> 23:07.680
you kill other people

23:07.680 --> 23:09.010
to extend your own life.

23:09.310 --> 23:10.440
That is wrong.

23:11.350 --> 23:12.920
You're so righteous.

23:13.480 --> 23:14.880
Even if you're right,

23:15.310 --> 23:16.510
there is one thing

23:16.510 --> 23:17.750
I am so curious about.

23:18.200 --> 23:19.750
You're a War Demon.

23:20.350 --> 23:22.680
Why are you fighting for their injustice?

23:22.720 --> 23:23.790
He is a War Demon?

23:23.810 --> 23:25.610
-He is a War Demon?
-A War Demon?

23:29.240 --> 23:30.590
You War Demons are

23:31.000 --> 23:32.270
truly useless.

23:32.590 --> 23:34.550
Born with the body of a demigod,

23:35.000 --> 23:36.640
a perfect War Demon has the power

23:36.640 --> 23:37.920
comparable to that of gods.

23:37.920 --> 23:39.860
Yet your race

23:39.890 --> 23:41.810
ended up being wiped out.

23:42.030 --> 23:44.000
Don't you wonder why?

23:47.070 --> 23:48.400
Because of weakness!

23:48.790 --> 23:50.650
You've got a body as tough as iron,

23:50.680 --> 23:51.480
but a heart

23:51.480 --> 23:53.480
that's way too soft and indecisive.

23:54.310 --> 23:55.550
I am not like you.

23:55.960 --> 23:57.070
I will work

23:57.480 --> 23:59.080
with whoever is useful to me.

23:59.270 --> 24:00.680
Relationships between people

24:00.680 --> 24:02.540
are simply about mutual exchange

24:02.590 --> 24:03.960
and exploitation.

24:04.480 --> 24:05.410
You're so lofty.

24:05.550 --> 24:06.350
Ask them

24:06.550 --> 24:08.790
if they want to join you.

24:18.920 --> 24:20.580
It is true that I am a War Demon.

24:20.730 --> 24:21.590
Your business with the immortal sects

24:21.590 --> 24:22.990
has nothing to do with me.

24:23.770 --> 24:25.640
But since you used the Wushuang Society

24:25.640 --> 24:26.840
to capture my friend,

24:27.350 --> 24:28.550
I won't let you go.

24:29.160 --> 24:30.310
Won't let me go?

24:32.360 --> 24:33.840
What can you do about it?

24:36.030 --> 24:37.550
Blood for blood!

25:11.510 --> 25:12.350
It's you.

25:14.280 --> 25:15.340
Are you surprised?

25:16.550 --> 25:17.270
I knew

25:17.270 --> 25:19.640
there was something wrong with you, bitch.

25:19.640 --> 25:21.680
You usually hid yourself quite well.

25:21.680 --> 25:23.920
You even suppressed
your cultivation level.

25:23.920 --> 25:25.050
I didn't expect that

25:25.480 --> 25:27.790
you had already reached
the Nascent Soul Stage.

25:27.790 --> 25:29.400
If I didn't hide my true strength,

25:29.400 --> 25:31.110
how could I kill you today?

25:34.920 --> 25:36.440
Why are you standing there?

25:36.440 --> 25:37.300
Waiting to die?

25:53.550 --> 25:54.510
Senior Bai.

26:00.360 --> 26:01.360
I'm fine.

26:02.350 --> 26:03.070
Go ahead.

26:39.200 --> 26:39.960
Gather.

26:42.510 --> 26:43.360
Burn.

27:01.110 --> 27:02.640
I can't hold on much longer.

27:02.880 --> 27:03.720
Sheng!

27:39.880 --> 27:40.640
No guards?

27:41.350 --> 27:42.350
They died inside.

27:44.200 --> 27:45.400
Where is Lu Qianqiao?

27:46.030 --> 27:46.830
We agreed that

27:46.960 --> 27:47.840
I would come to save you,

27:47.840 --> 27:48.680
while he stayed in the hall

27:48.680 --> 27:49.810
to stall the Master.

27:50.310 --> 27:51.240
Just him alone?

27:55.400 --> 27:56.060
Senior Bai,

27:56.240 --> 27:57.200
you are seriously injured.

27:57.200 --> 27:58.480
Find a place to hide first,

27:58.480 --> 27:59.740
and we will go help him.

27:59.880 --> 28:00.510
Okay.

28:34.840 --> 28:35.600
Are you okay?

28:36.400 --> 28:37.110
I'm fine.

28:45.910 --> 28:46.870
Lu Qianqiao!

28:48.240 --> 28:48.970
Are you okay?

28:50.350 --> 28:51.030
I'm fine.

28:51.440 --> 28:52.300
And how are you?

28:52.750 --> 28:53.610
I'm doing well.

28:58.720 --> 28:59.510
Yingying,

29:00.110 --> 29:01.750
I am very disappointed in you.

29:01.750 --> 29:03.240
You've never had hope,

29:03.480 --> 29:05.200
so how can you be disappointed?

29:05.200 --> 29:06.980
I am just more clear-headed than they are.

29:06.980 --> 29:07.850
I saw through

29:07.880 --> 29:09.000
your dirty deeds long ago

29:09.000 --> 29:10.880
and would no longer be deceived by you.

29:10.880 --> 29:12.440
You would rather choose

29:12.510 --> 29:14.510
a War Demon everyone hates

29:15.240 --> 29:16.800
than your own master

29:16.830 --> 29:18.720
who treats you as his own,

29:19.070 --> 29:19.720
right?

29:21.000 --> 29:21.750
Exactly.

29:24.350 --> 29:26.070
You've all heard the truth.

29:26.590 --> 29:29.510
Are you still willing to work for me?

29:36.230 --> 29:37.550
We stand firmly with the Master

29:37.550 --> 29:38.590
to the bitter end!

29:39.350 --> 29:41.070
We stand firmly with the Master

29:41.070 --> 29:42.550
to the bitter end!

29:45.700 --> 29:46.400
You've all already

29:46.400 --> 29:47.640
known his true colors.

29:47.640 --> 29:48.840
Why still follow him?

29:49.320 --> 29:50.310
No matter how we fight

29:50.310 --> 29:51.370
the Immortal Race,

29:51.640 --> 29:52.700
that is, in the end,

29:52.730 --> 29:54.930
an internal conflict of the Human Race.

29:54.960 --> 29:55.630
But he is

29:55.750 --> 29:56.480
a War Demon!

29:56.480 --> 29:57.810
He is everyone's enemy!

29:58.350 --> 30:00.010
All War Demons deserve to die!

30:00.070 --> 30:01.330
You helped a War Demon,

30:01.790 --> 30:03.250
so you deserve to die, too!

30:03.510 --> 30:04.200
Yes!

30:04.350 --> 30:05.640
The War Demons and we

30:05.790 --> 30:07.070
can never coexist!

30:08.400 --> 30:09.160
They just choose

30:09.160 --> 30:10.240
to side with power.

30:10.960 --> 30:12.220
They'd turn to whoever

30:12.350 --> 30:13.480
gives them power.

30:14.110 --> 30:15.830
Be it the hatred
towards the immortal sects

30:15.830 --> 30:17.510
or the hatred towards the War Demons,

30:17.510 --> 30:18.200
it's nothing

30:18.200 --> 30:20.000
but your high-sounding excuse!

30:20.030 --> 30:21.480
Your words

30:21.830 --> 30:23.240
are quite insightful.

30:25.000 --> 30:25.750
Lu,

30:26.270 --> 30:28.480
since I knew you'd come today,

30:28.790 --> 30:30.160
wouldn't I be prepared?

30:31.100 --> 30:32.060
Lord Baori!

30:32.270 --> 30:34.070
We should've done this earlier!

30:48.510 --> 30:49.790
I must remind you

30:50.270 --> 30:52.470
that Fu Tian is a Void Stage cultivator.

30:52.570 --> 30:53.650
Besides, he has

30:53.680 --> 30:55.030
2 Void Stage Guardians

30:55.160 --> 30:56.790
and 3 Dharma Kings by his side,

30:56.790 --> 30:58.200
not to mention the numerous

30:58.200 --> 30:59.530
capable men in the sect.

30:59.920 --> 31:01.050
How can you kill him?

31:02.440 --> 31:04.100
Did you bring what I asked for?

31:07.400 --> 31:08.310
This magical artifact

31:08.310 --> 31:10.310
has the power
to rewind time for a short while.

31:10.310 --> 31:11.960
By sacrificing your own essence blood,

31:11.960 --> 31:13.370
you can restore your body

31:13.400 --> 31:15.110
to a certain state in the past.

31:25.100 --> 31:26.910
This is Gui's Sunblock Banner?

31:27.070 --> 31:27.750
Exactly.

31:28.440 --> 31:29.640
I modified it a bit.

31:30.830 --> 31:32.030
How come I didn't know

31:32.680 --> 31:34.830
that woman taught you formations?

31:35.350 --> 31:36.950
There's a lot you don't know.

32:02.220 --> 32:05.420
♪ With tear-filled eyes,
we face the desolate wilds ♪

32:04.000 --> 32:04.790
Lu Qianqiao!

32:05.450 --> 32:08.120
♪ A thousand piles of withered bones ♪

32:08.360 --> 32:11.110
♪ The lowly, in mortal flesh,
march first ♪

32:11.130 --> 32:13.670
♪ All offered up in sacrifice ♪

32:14.600 --> 32:17.790
♪ To build the stairway to the heavens ♪

32:18.030 --> 32:19.310
Though I am one of the War Demons,

32:18.330 --> 32:20.770
♪ Forging an undying obsession ♪

32:20.310 --> 32:21.750
I don't want to be a War Demon.

32:21.430 --> 32:26.040
♪ The blade is stained with blood,
and with countless tears ♪

32:22.400 --> 32:23.660
I just want to be human.

32:24.240 --> 32:25.350
For my wish,

32:26.200 --> 32:27.000
I shed my skin,

32:27.000 --> 32:29.640
♪ Sparks boil over,
and demons run rampant ♪

32:27.200 --> 32:28.060
renewed bones,

32:28.160 --> 32:29.290
and replaced flesh.

32:29.400 --> 32:30.750
Every time I succeeded,

32:29.960 --> 32:31.960
♪ Heaven and earth
are destroyed together ♪

32:31.480 --> 32:33.110
my cultivation
would decrease significantly.

32:32.900 --> 32:34.490
♪ Deeply knowing that the common people ♪

32:33.750 --> 32:35.070
But I'm still happy

32:34.550 --> 32:38.250
♪ Are an untouchable weakness ♪

32:36.240 --> 32:37.350
that I can see

32:37.350 --> 32:38.590
this colorful world,

32:39.110 --> 32:40.310
and that I can feel pain.

32:39.210 --> 32:42.590
♪ Do not turn back
to the pain of the past ♪

32:41.160 --> 32:42.720
And this feeling makes me

32:42.900 --> 32:45.660
♪ Mindless killing must not be done ♪

32:43.550 --> 32:45.070
feel truly alive.

32:45.830 --> 32:50.750
♪ With a clear conscience, a grand spirit
overpowers the majesty of heaven ♪

32:51.260 --> 32:53.510
♪ I ask the Nine Heavens:
what is the purpose of this life? ♪

32:53.540 --> 32:56.330
♪ With my spine as my monument,
I shall never kneel ♪

32:53.750 --> 32:54.550
Void Stage?

32:55.240 --> 32:55.880
No,

32:56.240 --> 32:57.400
his level is still rising!

32:57.300 --> 32:59.400
♪ Though this life be wretched,
I will not sink so low ♪

32:59.430 --> 33:02.240
♪ As to become a puppet of fate ♪

33:03.370 --> 33:05.730
♪ What is the purpose of life?
To draw my blade and slay evil ♪

33:05.270 --> 33:06.510
Great Completion Stage?

33:05.750 --> 33:08.970
♪ Even if I am turned to dust,
I will not regret ♪

33:09.900 --> 33:11.900
♪ By my will,
I shall bring back the sun and moon ♪

33:09.920 --> 33:10.830
Oh, my god.

33:11.960 --> 33:14.910
♪ And restore clear radiance
to the mortal realm ♪

33:15.550 --> 33:18.910
♪ Rather than bowing my back
to apologize to the Heavens ♪

33:15.880 --> 33:18.110
Lu succeeded in renewing blood.

33:19.270 --> 33:22.020
♪ I would sooner rewrite
this fated calamity ♪

33:22.210 --> 33:24.730
♪ I demand the story
follow my own desire ♪

33:24.940 --> 33:27.530
♪ To serve as its final conclusion ♪

33:37.200 --> 33:38.400
How is that possible?

33:48.260 --> 33:49.050
That's because you

33:49.050 --> 33:49.970
have no idea

33:50.830 --> 33:52.350
what I've sacrificed

33:52.720 --> 33:54.240
to be an ordinary person.

33:55.640 --> 33:56.750
You used her spells

33:57.140 --> 33:59.140
to collude with the immortal sects,

33:59.510 --> 34:01.200
steal others' immortal perception,

34:01.200 --> 34:02.800
and deceive your followers.

34:03.110 --> 34:03.750
Fan,

34:04.550 --> 34:06.010
do you admit your mistake?

34:06.830 --> 34:08.070
Why should I admit it?

34:08.920 --> 34:10.150
Why should I?

34:10.590 --> 34:11.960
What mistake did I make?

34:12.920 --> 34:15.110
People are born with distinctions
of noble and humble,

34:15.110 --> 34:16.320
rich and poor,

34:16.590 --> 34:18.150
immortal and mortal!

34:19.150 --> 34:20.710
Some are high above,

34:20.880 --> 34:23.070
while some are as lowly as ants.

34:23.960 --> 34:25.190
Why must I be

34:25.670 --> 34:27.150
the one crawling on the ground?

34:27.150 --> 34:28.190
I am not resigned to this!

34:28.190 --> 34:30.449
I will change my fate against God's will!

34:30.800 --> 34:32.429
I will make you all know

34:33.190 --> 34:35.150
what it feels like to have nothing!

34:37.280 --> 34:38.230
Why did you end up

34:38.230 --> 34:39.150
like this today?

34:39.150 --> 34:41.210
Stop saying those disgusting words.

34:41.360 --> 34:43.590
Survival of the fittest.

34:44.030 --> 34:44.960
Lu.

34:47.030 --> 34:48.800
I suggest you sober up.

34:49.590 --> 34:51.630
In this world
where people prey on each other,

34:51.630 --> 34:52.760
the foolish

34:54.440 --> 34:55.840
can't live long.

35:58.860 --> 36:00.460
[Guiyuan Hall]

36:17.070 --> 36:19.330
It hasn't rained on the mountain, right?

36:22.670 --> 36:23.510
Senior Brother,

36:23.510 --> 36:25.110
it hasn't rained this month.

36:26.190 --> 36:27.720
How is it down the mountain?

36:27.880 --> 36:29.030
It rained once on the 5th.

36:29.030 --> 36:30.290
It started at 7:30 a.m.

36:30.360 --> 36:31.510
and stopped at 9 a.m.

36:36.150 --> 36:37.510
Don't worry, Senior Brother.

36:37.510 --> 36:38.360
The disciples have dug

36:38.360 --> 36:39.440
another well down the mountain,

36:39.440 --> 36:42.300
so there's no problem
with drinking or using water.

36:52.590 --> 36:53.250
Here we are.

36:55.480 --> 36:56.320
-Senior Brother Bai.
-Senior Brother Bai.

36:56.320 --> 36:57.030
-Senior Lin.
-Senior Lin.

36:57.030 --> 36:58.690
-Senior Jiang.
-Senior Jiang

37:00.460 --> 37:03.690
[Tianyuan Sect]

38:02.440 --> 38:03.100
Senior Bai!

38:03.190 --> 38:04.400
-Senior Brother Bai!
-Senior Brother Bai!

38:04.400 --> 38:05.060
Senior Bai.

38:05.280 --> 38:06.410
Senior Bai, wake up!

38:06.440 --> 38:07.590
-Senior...
-Senior Bai.

38:07.590 --> 38:08.880
-We're back in the sect.
-Senior Brother Bai.

38:08.880 --> 38:09.960
-Senior Jiang.
-Senior.

38:09.960 --> 38:11.480
What exactly happened
to Senior Brother Bai?

38:11.480 --> 38:12.940
He was harmed by villains.

38:13.300 --> 38:14.710
Hurry and help him inside.

38:14.710 --> 38:15.510
Okay.

38:16.920 --> 38:17.650
Sect Leader.

38:18.880 --> 38:19.610
Sect Leader,

38:19.920 --> 38:20.980
Senior Bai is back.

38:21.190 --> 38:22.450
He fainted at the gate.

38:25.920 --> 38:27.020
What happened to Senior Brother Bai?

38:27.020 --> 38:27.950
Is he sick?

38:27.970 --> 38:28.760
I heard he was seriously injured.

38:28.760 --> 38:29.190
Will Senior Brother Bai

38:29.190 --> 38:29.630
get through this?

38:29.630 --> 38:30.890
-Don't jinx it.
-Yeah.

38:48.840 --> 38:49.370
Make way.

38:49.880 --> 38:51.010
Make way, everyone.

38:54.550 --> 38:56.320
Greetings, Sect Leader.

39:01.050 --> 39:01.650
Master Li.

39:02.110 --> 39:02.710
Sir,

39:04.440 --> 39:05.000
I guess we don't

39:05.000 --> 39:06.800
need so many people inside, huh?

39:24.440 --> 39:25.150
Master Li.

39:26.230 --> 39:27.140
How is Bai?

39:27.400 --> 39:27.920
He...

39:30.000 --> 39:32.660
The physician said
he's in a very bad condition.

39:58.710 --> 40:00.370
Where did Senior Bai get hurt?

40:00.550 --> 40:02.110
How could he be so badly injured?

40:02.110 --> 40:03.190
I heard from the physician

40:03.190 --> 40:04.400
that his immortal perception was dug out,

40:04.400 --> 40:05.670
and his Qihai was damaged.

40:05.670 --> 40:06.590
His cultivation level

40:06.590 --> 40:07.970
has dropped to the bottom.

40:07.970 --> 40:08.980
No way...

40:09.360 --> 40:11.400
He is now no different
from an ordinary mortal.

40:11.400 --> 40:12.000
Nonsense!

40:14.190 --> 40:15.320
It's what the physician said,

40:15.320 --> 40:16.230
not me.

40:16.510 --> 40:17.910
Why are you yelling at me?

40:18.360 --> 40:19.000
What?

40:19.480 --> 40:21.030
Are you afraid that without Senior Bai,

40:21.030 --> 40:22.360
no one will protect you?

40:22.360 --> 40:22.920
You...

40:23.150 --> 40:23.840
Enough.

40:31.420 --> 40:34.940
[Baosu Courtyard]

40:41.400 --> 40:42.000
Master Li,

40:42.320 --> 40:43.400
how is Senior Bai?

40:44.070 --> 40:45.590
His immortal perception was snatched,

40:45.590 --> 40:47.030
his spiritual veins were destroyed,

40:47.030 --> 40:48.630
and his energy base is empty.

40:48.800 --> 40:50.030
The spiritual energy accumulated

40:50.030 --> 40:52.960
over decades of cultivation
vanished in an instant.

40:53.230 --> 40:54.280
Surviving this is

40:54.960 --> 40:56.260
already a miracle.

40:59.840 --> 41:01.170
Let Bai have a good rest.

41:01.510 --> 41:03.370
And I have some questions for you.

41:16.330 --> 41:19.660
[Liubo Temple]

41:40.150 --> 41:41.610
Whenever you do some work,

41:41.880 --> 41:43.110
you are either drinking water

41:43.110 --> 41:44.240
or using the toilet.

41:45.410 --> 41:46.370
It didn't delay

41:46.400 --> 41:47.460
my carving anyway.

41:50.360 --> 41:51.070
See?

41:51.480 --> 41:52.480
How many volumes?

41:53.590 --> 41:54.450
Three volumes.

41:54.710 --> 41:55.880
I'm not like you,

41:56.070 --> 41:57.760
who eats as soon as your eyes open

41:57.760 --> 41:59.320
and sleeps as soon as they close.

41:59.320 --> 42:00.690
You don't do any work yourself,

42:00.690 --> 42:01.950
but love to nag others.

42:04.190 --> 42:05.320
You also did a good job.

42:05.320 --> 42:06.380
Congratulations.

42:07.150 --> 42:08.400
You carved quite fast.

42:08.400 --> 42:10.320
You almost caught up to half of Sheng's

42:10.320 --> 42:11.110
half speed.

42:12.840 --> 42:14.040
How is that possible?

42:14.360 --> 42:15.620
Which volume is she on?

42:16.440 --> 42:18.170
I didn't pay attention to that.

42:18.360 --> 42:19.320
It's just that

42:19.510 --> 42:20.630
she seemed to be doing faster than you.
